Description: Fessel robot-arm monitoring (Pi side)
 supervisor (safety/control plane + MQTT relay), video (GStreamer pipeline +
 live state machine + ring buffer + explicit recordings), and uploader (ships
 flagged recordings to MinIO), shipped as system-integrated Python modules
 under /opt/fessel/lib relying on Debian python3-* packages (no venv), with
 launcher wrappers in /usr/bin and their systemd units. The uploader's MinIO
 driver needs python3-minio (Recommends) for the production 'minio' driver; the
 import is lazy so the package installs and the 'fake' driver runs without it.
 Configuration lives in /etc/fessel and is preserved across upgrades.

